.TH "PERCH-RECONCILE" "1" "" "perch" "perch manual"
.SH NAME
perch\-reconcile \- force one S3 bucket reconciliation pass
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perch reconcile [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Scan the configured S3 bucket and bind objects written by mxRaven to local message metadata. Requires storage.mode=s3.
.SH NOTES
.IP \(bu 2
serve runs this at startup and every storage.s3.reconcile_every (default 5m).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-config <value>
configuration file (default: ~/.config/perch/perch.yaml)
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
show help
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
perch reconcile \-\-config /etc/perch/perch.yaml
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBperch\fR(1)
